WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.780
The one-on-one fights that took 
place in the sky and on land:

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:05.870
Nanami-sama and the chief,

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:08.750
and the serious battle between 
the Princess and Rebecca-sama!

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.530
There were countless exciting things,

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.100
like plenty of fanshots,

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.690
the appearance of Hero Mask, and so on.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:17.160
So what was the result after that kind

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:18.760
of opening day of Union Fest?

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.640
Change My Heart

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:59.640
The opening battle of 
the Union Fest is over!

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:02.860
We will now announce the 
battle results on the stage!

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.220
This is quite unexpected,

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.730
but the Principality of 
Pastillage is in first place!

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.390
They were slightly behind 
in the beginning,

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:11.390
but started to catch up at an 
incredible pace in the second half.

00:02:11.390 --> 00:02:13.850
In the end, they pulled 
through and caused an upset!

00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:15.940
Couverte-sama, what would you say 
lead to your victory this time?

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:20.000
Well, of course all of our 
people did their very best,

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.700
but it might have been 
that person over there.

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:28.500
People of Pastillage, 
I am here to aid you,

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:30.250
the undefeatable Hero Mask!

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:34.060
Did Adel-sama stop caring 
about hiding her face?

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:36.210
Looks like she's really let herself go.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:37.820
Hero Mask!

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:40.350
Next time you'll have to face me, too!

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:41.300
Me, too!

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:44.500
Very well, Leonmichelli and Nanami,

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:45.930
I will meet you in battle!

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.050
She's really popular!

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:51.190
Pastillage's savior, Hero Mask!

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:54.060
The spectators already love her!

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:59.400
Let's all do our best again tomorrow!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.100
The second day will be a sea battle!

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:07.250
All the contestants for 
the various beach events

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:10.210
have already gathered here 
on this beach battlefield!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:11.360
The intra-country friendship

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.790
marine race will be held here, too!

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.780
Also, on the field specially 
set up for it,

00:03:22.780 --> 00:03:24.150
the Princess' project

00:03:24.150 --> 00:03:26.220
"Mounted Battle by the 
Sea - Water battle"

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.200
is about to begin!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.480
Let the water battle by the sea begin!

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:41.040
The sky we both

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:44.740
gazed up at on that day

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.740
Galette army! Advance!

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.140
I'll never forget it.

00:03:45.850 --> 00:03:47.490
I love these events!

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:50.540
All right, let's just keep our 
lead all the way to the end!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:52.760
Wishing that we could all

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:51.370
Indeed!

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:53.120
I'll do my best!

00:03:52.760 --> 00:04:00.040
run together someday.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.380
We'll go in as well!

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.760
It's not "Goodbye",

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:06.580
it's "we will meet again."

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:11.640
Because I know my wish will come true!

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:18.520
Let's embrace our passionate memories

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:22.870
of those days that we rushed through.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:29.080
That promise we made 
hand in hand.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:35.030
We will meet again and it'll come true.

00:04:33.060 --> 00:04:34.920
As you can see, the second 
day of Union Fest

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.670
was another huge success.

00:04:35.030 --> 00:04:40.780
I'll wait forever.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:37.900
Obviously, there were many

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:40.080
more events after that and Rico-chan

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:43.300
and Noir-chan even scored 
big at a quiz competition.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.690
Yes, Chief Ricotta!

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:47.050
General Godwin!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.010
Correct!

00:04:51.260 --> 00:04:54.060
Knights and common 
folk mingled on stage

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:55.800
and everybody had fun together.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:04:59.880
Next, next.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.960
The level of excitement

00:05:06.960 --> 00:05:08.820
stayed high during the 
rest of the events...

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:20.350
As of today, all the 
war games between our

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.340
three countries have been concluded.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:26.410
The sporting 
and art events

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:28.390
are still going on and there's 
also the final stage

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:29.560
that'll take place on the last day.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.600
But, for now, we've 
concluded this section.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:36.210
There were no major accidents 
or other trouble

00:05:36.210 --> 00:05:38.390
during the large scale 
events, which is all

00:05:38.390 --> 00:05:40.500
thanks to your hard work.

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:44.600
Let's hear a toast 
from the representative

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:46.730
of the three countries' 
knight orders, Lord Risler.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:48.860
What? Me?

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:50.370
Please.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:52.870
Lord Risler!

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:56.370
Um, then I'd like to

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.480
toast to the continued peace, 
prosperity, and even better

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.420
cooperation between the three countries.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:02.680
Cheers!

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:04.940
Cheers!

00:06:04.940 --> 00:06:05.710
Sink.

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:07.920
Good work.

00:06:07.920 --> 00:06:10.350
Becky, Cou-sama. Good work.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.750
Sink, you're going on a walk with

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.260
the Princess again 
tomorrow morning, right?

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:17.270
Yeah, she said there's a 
place she wanted to go to.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.710
Yes, so about that...

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:21.650
Oh, Cou-sama, Rebecca-san.

00:06:22.050 --> 00:06:23.090
Princess.

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:25.400
Millihi-nee, perfect timing!

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:26.400
Yes?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.420
You're have your on-air performance

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.170
in our country tomorrow, right?

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:34.530
Rebecca and I wanted to bring you.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:36.370
Wow, thank you.

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:38.870
Where will you be going 
for your walk tomorrow?

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:40.710
Since we have some time,

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.280
I wanted to go to a place

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.920
with many memories that 
we haven't been to lately.

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:03.300
I haven't been to this 
stream in a while.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.690
Sink, you had your training 
camp here last time, right?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.900
Yes, with Yukki, Ecle, and Noir.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.450
Princess! Sink!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:13.820
Yukikaze!

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:22.460
I apologize for wanting 
to come over so suddenly.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:23.930
Please don't apologize,

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:25.960
you're always more than welcome!

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:29.010
Are Lady d'Arquien and 
Isuka-san in today?

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.880
They left early in the morning

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:35.100
to get some metal for his swordsmithing.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.600
I see.

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:40.040
The only ones at our house 
are Kanata and myself,

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.440
so please stay as long as you wish.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:56.620
Here you go, Princess.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.750
Thank you!

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:03.870
Yukikaze's tail pillow!

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.680
It's just as fluffy and 
soft as I remember!

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:10.310
Sink, want to try it, too?

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:11.550
It's really fluffy!

00:08:12.410 --> 00:08:15.140
Uh, I guess I'll try later.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.630
Here you go.

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:18.760
Thank you!

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:22.770
You two really get along well.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:26.290
She played with me a lot 
when I was smaller.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:30.190
No no, you were the one 
who took care of me.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:34.990
When you were young,
 I was a tiny thing, too.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:36.820
Oh, really?

00:08:37.060 --> 00:08:39.080
Right, Kanata-san?

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:42.000
Yes, you're right.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.990
I suspect that it's thanks 
to the Princess and

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:46.720
Ecle and the others that Yuki-chan

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:47.960
grew into what she is now.

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:51.470
Normally local gods grow 
bigger when their god rank

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:55.340
goes up after they've done
enough virtuous deeds.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:58.420
From the time the lady picked me up

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:01.850
until very recently,
 I was always a tiny thing...

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.550
There was even a time

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:05.680
when you were smaller 
than Ecle or myself.

00:09:05.680 --> 00:09:09.410
Yes, but I guess seeing 
you get bigger each day

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:13.220
made me want to be bigger, too.

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:15.610
So I trained really hard

00:09:15.610 --> 00:09:18.740
and when I realized what had happened,

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.040
I was this big.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:24.320
It was hard to keep her clothed

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:26.620
because she grew so quickly!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.130
But I really think I won't 
get any taller than this.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:49.270
Thank you for the meal!

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:51.480
Uh, Princess?

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:53.410
Did something happen?

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:56.240
No, I just saw something 
on the ground...

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.330
See, this.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.630
A jewel? Or egg?

00:10:02.630 --> 00:10:05.330
I've never seen that before.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:09.330
Does it belong to 
Isuka-san or Adel-sama?

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:18.120
Princess! Yuki-chan! Hero!

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:30.850
An... animal?

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:32.690
A local god?

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.280
Are you all okay?!

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:40.280
What happened?

00:10:42.270 --> 00:10:43.920
Uh, Hero?

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:44.880
Yes?

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.980
Huh? No, I didn't mean you, Yuki-chan.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:51.350
No, I'm over here.

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:54.530
Why am I over there?!

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:04.970
This is...

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.750
Y-Yukki...

00:11:09.990 --> 00:11:14.580
I am over there, this is 
the Princess' body...

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:17.570
I am Sink...

00:11:18.300 --> 00:11:21.320
And the Princess is me, Yukikaze...

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:23.890
We got switched around...

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.210
Could it be?

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.610
Princess?

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:38.240
Th-then who's inside the 
Hero who just left?

00:11:38.240 --> 00:11:40.920
Probably what was in this 
little thing before...

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.070
We'll have to catch it quickly!

00:11:49.070 --> 00:11:52.360
Let's call for help! Brave Connect On!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:54.440
It won't work...

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.710
I see, it makes sense that our moves

00:11:56.710 --> 00:11:58.860
won't work with a different body.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:02.070
Sink, we'll have to 
chase the escaped Sink!

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:05.700
All right, Princes- I mean Yukki!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:09.690
But you can't run around like that.

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:12.710
I'll get my clothes- whoa?!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.210
My legs won't move like 
I want them to...

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.860
Princ- Yukki!

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:19.960
...move...

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:27.570
All done.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:33.310
I will hurry and find myself!

00:12:33.780 --> 00:12:36.470
Yukki, you keep the 
Princess' body safe!

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:37.860
Roger.

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:42.620
I'll make sure to treat 
Yukki's body carefully!

00:12:46.130 --> 00:12:49.910
But still, we can't just 
leave it all to Sink alone.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:53.080
Don't worry Prince- Yuki-chan.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:59.840
The Secret Squad's 
already on the hunt.

00:13:09.590 --> 00:13:11.180
I jumped too far!

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:29.990
I have to remember how 
Yukki runs and moves.

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:10.690
That's the sign to meet up!

00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:15.500
Princess, Yukki!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.460
Sink!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:20.850
We found out where your body is.

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:21.770
Really?

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:25.550
It's through the eastern path, 
by the the old pine tree.

00:14:25.930 --> 00:14:28.560
The Secret Squad's got it surrounded,

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:31.100
but then it climbed up the tree...

00:14:31.100 --> 00:14:33.200
Nice work Secret Squad!

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:35.230
Then we can catch it right away!

00:14:35.230 --> 00:14:36.640
Can you do it?

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:39.400
Yes! Let's catch it with teamwork!

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.390
Yup!

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:00.170
Hero Style Ninja Art 
- Lightning Blossom!

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:20.610
Holy Ray!

00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:26.310
There!

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:37.490
Hero Kick!

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:53.900
Prince- Yuki-chan!

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.010
Why you...

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:58.600
Braze Drive - Hurricane!

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.290
Justice is served!

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:21.660
Princess, Yukki, Kanata-san. 
Are you all right?

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:22.950
Y-Yes.

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:24.920
Sink, well done!

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:39.060
Don't tell me it's happening again...

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:41.980
Let's confirm.

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.440
I'm still Sink in Yukki.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:48.450
I'm Millihiore. I'm back.

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:56.620
Inside Sink is me indeed.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:58.420
That means...

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:00.930
The monster and the Princess are back in

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.930
their own bodies while Yukki 
and myself are switched?

00:17:03.930 --> 00:17:07.280
That's all thanks to 
your quick judgment.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:09.340
Nicely done.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.280
It would have been 
nice if you two could

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:12.810
have returned to normal as well.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.280
I remembered that Sink was holding

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:21.210
that jewel when we first got switched.

00:17:21.210 --> 00:17:24.230
So I thought that this little guy maybe

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:26.400
switches bodies with 
the one closest to it.

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:28.210
And when that happens,

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:30.650
those who are close to 
it also get switched.

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:33.990
Yes, probably.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:35.940
But I'm glad that at least the

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.950
Princess was able to get her body back.

00:17:37.950 --> 00:17:40.320
Let's quickly find a way to get Sink and

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.800
Yukikaze back to normal.

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:42.450
Yeah.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:45.960
Yukki, can you try using 
the Brave Connect?

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.710
I'll try.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.960
Brave Connect On!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.000
I-I'm sorry!

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:58.250
I forgot that thing there.

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:01.710
That little one isn't a 
monster, but a sprite.

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:06.180
I took it there to set it 
free far from civilization, but...

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:09.810
But last night you got too 
excited and forgot, right?

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.320
How do we get back to normal?

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.270
You should return to normal 
without having to do anything,

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:17.370
but we're on our way there now.

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.570
We'll go there at supersonic speeds!

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:24.830
Hey, Sink!

00:18:24.830 --> 00:18:26.930
We're coming to pick you up!

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:29.580
We'll arrive at the 
Fuugetsu Lodge soon!

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:32.820
We have to explain this, right?

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:33.840
Yes.

00:18:34.250 --> 00:18:35.570
Your bodies got switched?

00:18:36.640 --> 00:18:38.910
Yes, right now I am Sink.

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:40.590
And I am Yukikaze!

00:18:40.900 --> 00:18:42.640
A body switching sprite.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:44.970
That's like a dream come true!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:47.790
With this thing the fun possibilities 
are nearly endless!

00:18:47.790 --> 00:18:50.350
Cou-sama! This is dangerous!

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:52.180
But... but...

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:55.300
We have to return it to Adel-sama. So no!

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:02.450
Sink, Yukikaze, I'm sorry.

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:07.480
This all happened because 
I found that jewel.

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.250
No, no, no, no.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:12.270
This is nothing for you to worry about.

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:15.300
We were able to resolve it 
through our teamwork anyway.

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:19.960
This will be just another 
fun memory from the summer.

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:20.800
Right!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:24.130
Right, then we'll be 
taking Millihi-nee with us!

00:19:24.130 --> 00:19:26.120
See you two later!

00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:28.810
Call us on the Brave Connect 
if anything happens.

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:30.260
Okay!

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:31.580
Have a safe trip!

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:43.650
Let's relax a bit until 
Adel-sama arrives.

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:44.280
Sure.

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:47.270
But since we got dirty during the fight,

00:19:47.270 --> 00:19:49.310
how about a bath?

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:51.060
That sounds good.

00:19:51.060 --> 00:19:52.690
Wait, right now's no good!

00:19:52.690 --> 00:19:55.690
Huh? I don't see any problem.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.260
Are we back to normal?

00:20:01.260 --> 00:20:03.880
I'm back! Yay!

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:05.160
Hooray!

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:07.780
My own body 
fits me the best.

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:08.590
Indeed.

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:10.310
It just feels right.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.520
Indeed.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.010
I really have to thank you

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:22.850
for treating my body with such care

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:25.030
when we were switched.

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:27.200
I'm glad I didn't fall 
down or something.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.700
You looked cool in action, too.

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:33.690
That's because it's easy 
to move in your body.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.430
If I try hard enough,

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:39.340
I think I can reproduce 
the "Body Switching" move.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:42.610
How about we try switching 
 bodies and not telling anybody?

00:20:44.160 --> 00:20:46.050
Hero Sink is here!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.180
Sounds like fun!

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:54.190
It's good Sink and Yuki-chan 
were able to return to normal.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.720
I'm so glad!

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.140
Since the Heroes have arrived,

00:20:57.140 --> 00:21:00.790
we haven't had a shortage of fun events.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:02.370
And lots of trouble.

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.660
Since it's all fun, it's all good.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:07.520
For me there've been a lot of firsts...

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:10.660
It's been a wonderful summer 
with plenty of great memories.

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:18.890
The Union Fest kind 
of went by in a blur.

00:21:18.890 --> 00:21:22.400
The time for you Heroes to 
return is drawing closer, too.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:25.090
I don't want to go home...

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.670
When you have days off over there,

00:21:26.670 --> 00:21:28.390
you're always welcome to come here.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:29.640
Okay!

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:33.180
Next time, we'll have to summon
 you at a more relaxing time,

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:36.310
so you won't have as
 much work as this time.

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:39.440
That's fine! I love the Hero work!

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:42.360
Oh, but I'd like to go out with

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.010
the three rulers and the three Heroes

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:45.650
before we go home.

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:49.420
True, at Pastillage that 
didn't really work out

00:21:49.420 --> 00:21:51.330
because of the trouble 
with the demon king.

00:21:51.670 --> 00:21:55.160
Let's have a nice summer 
memory of just being lazy!

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:33.630
It looks like I got too excited.

00:23:33.630 --> 00:23:35.390
I've sealed away that mask.

00:23:35.300 --> 00:25:00.000
<b>Final Stage</b>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.150
Then let me show you my 
Ninja Art - Body Switching!

00:23:38.150 --> 00:23:39.740
We're not doing that!
